TEXT -192 -64 Left 2 ;Here the line is set to 1000km and gen2 gets a static controller\nThe line is now much to long for 20kV voltage level\nYou can see that the frequency of gen1 and gen2 gets\ndecoupled. Therefore the static of gen2 has to be\nadapted to the frequency of gen1.\nThis is done at t=50s till t=60s
